POST /openapi/v1/reward/callback
```

示例：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/openapi/v1/reward/callback \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "commandId": "cmd_xxx",
    "tenantId": "site_001",
    "status": "SUCCESS",
    "externalGrantId": "wallet_bill_888",
    "message": "granted",
    "finishedAt": "2026-05-24T12:00:03Z"
  }'
```

